:: OC Erin Clothes Stolen Locker Room [nobr]

/* Intro */
You quickly shower and finish up, drying your hair with the towel before wrapping it around your waist and walking back to the locker room to get dressed. You hear the normal teasing and hushed laughter of boys messing with each other, <span style="color:Yellow">but ignore it until you hear a loud swearing cry.</span> <br>

