<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"Such dirty language!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> taunts, sounding faux shocked, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"You really should watch that mouth of yours, before it gets you into trouble! Tell you what, if you apologize for using such bad words and ask REALLY nicely, I might give you your clothes back. What do you say?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> asks with a smirk. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"You-!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span> grinds his teeth in anger, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> just stands there waiting for his apology. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"Fuck you!”</span> Instead of apologizing, <span style="color:Yellow"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span> kicks <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> in the shin as hard as he can.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"Ah! Bitch!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> curses, dropping the clothes to grip his bruised ankle. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"Oh? You wanna play like that huh? Alright!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> <span style="color:Pink">grabs <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span> before he can reach his clothes and the two quickly begin to struggle back and forth. Unfortunately for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span>, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> is much stronger and quickly gets the upper hand. He drags him over to the door, which one of his goons happily opens. Then, without an ounce of compassion, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> shoves <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span> out into the hallway and slams the door shut. As the sound echoes, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> turns around and holds up his victory prize: <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span>’s towel. <br>

