Chuckles of amusement fill the room as everyone realizes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span> is now out in the hallway butt naked, without even his towel to cover himself with. You hear struggling and muffled curses as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span> tries to pry the door open to get back inside, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>’s goons hold it tight.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"What’s going on out here!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Coach Kohler</span> shouts, poking his head out of his office, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">"Better not be messing around!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> glances at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>, though he innocently stands by, tossing what could be mistaken as his towel in the hamper.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>’s goons, meanwhile, are out of sight. <span style="color:Yellow">No one else seems to be willing to snitch, leaving <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span>’s only hope of being allowed in before the bell rings and the hall becomes full of witnesses you.</span> <br>
