        <span style="color:Pink">You quickly call out to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Coach Kohler</span>, snitching and telling him that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and his goons tossed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Erin</span> out into the hallway without his clothes.</span> <span style="color:Yellow"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> instantly turns to you with a look of rage, muttering under his breath that you’ll suffer worse if you don’t shut your mouth, but the damage is already done as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Coach Kohler</span> yells out.</span> <br>
